# brock

--- RocketGirl_Jump | gadget | TID_ROCKETGIRL_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Brock rocket jumps, knocking back enemies and dealing <!buddy.accessory.skill.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> damage on takeoff and landing. Hitting an enemy Brawler gives +<!buddy.component.statuseffect.duration.ticksasseconds> sec movement speed.
now  Brock rocket jumps, knocking back enemies and dealing <!buddy.accessory.skill.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> damage on takeoff and landing. Hitting an enemy Brawler gives +2 sec movement speed.
  buddy.accessory.skill.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel  -  -> 1000
  buddy.component.statuseffect.duration.ticksasseconds  2  -> 2

--- RocketGirl_Jump | gadget | TID_ROCKETGIRL_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DIFF
raw  Hitting an enemy Brawler gives +<!buddy.component.statuseffect.duration.ticksasseconds> sec movement speed.
now  Hitting an enemy Brawler gives +2 sec movement speed.
  buddy.component.statuseffect.duration.ticksasseconds  2  -> 2

--- RocketGirl_MegaRocket | gadget | TID_ROCKETGIRL_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Brock fires a large rocket, destroying terrain and dealing <!buddy.accessory.skill.damage.scaletolevel> damage. The rocket breaks into smaller rockets after exploding, which also do damage.
now  Brock fires a large rocket, destroying terrain and dealing 2000 damage. The rocket breaks into smaller rockets after exploding, which also do damage.
  buddy.accessory.skill.damage.scaletolevel  2000  -> 2000

--- RocketGirl_MegaRocket | gadget | TID_ROCKETGIRL_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DIFF
raw  The rocket breaks into <!buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.chainbullets> smaller rockets after exploding that also do damage.
now  The rocket breaks into 4 smaller rockets after exploding that also do damage.
  buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.chainbullets  4  -> 4

